Package: standdensity
Type: Package
Title: Parameterized Stand Density Management Models
Version: 0.2.0
Author: Ji Jinrui [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Ji Jinrui <jijinruibrian@icloud.com>
Description: A parameterized, reusable and transferable stand density
    management model. Given a species code, the package returns that species'
    parameter equations, self-thinning line, density and stability
    classification, predicted stand variables and density management diagram.
    Seven classic relative-spacing SDMD species are included: Chinese fir,
    pedunculate oak, radiata pine, sweet chestnut, birch, Douglas-fir in Spain
    and sweet chestnut coppice. Local data can be used to fit and register
    additional species or regions.
